{
  "api": "openai",
  "from_version": "v0",
  "to_version": "v1",
  "summary": "Upgraded to v1 with switch from global `openai` usage to explicit `client = OpenAI()` instantiation (global `openai.*` retained only for REPLs/notebooks), renaming `api_base`->`base_url`, `proxy`->`proxies`, `api_resources`->`resources` and `InvalidRequestError`->`BadRequestError`, and moving all operations to `client.*` (e.g. `ChatCompletion.create()`->`chat.completions.create()`, `Audio.transcribe()`->`audio.transcriptions.create()`, `Image.create()`->`images.generate()`, `Image.create_edit()`->`images.edit()`, `File.download()`->`files.retrieve_content()`, `FineTune.stream_events()`->`fine_tunes.list_events(stream=True)`). Response objects are now pydantic models not dicts (use attribute access and `model.model_dump()`/`model_dump_json()`), `list()` methods now auto-iterate replacing `.auto_paging_iter()`, all `a*` methods removed requiring the async client, and HTTP layer now uses `httpx` replacing `requestssession`/`aiosession`. Removed `api_key_path`, `app_info`, `debug`, `log`, `OpenAIError`, `ErrorObject`, `Customer`, `api_version`, `verify_ssl_certs`, `api_type`, `enable_telemetry`, `ca_bundle_path`, `Engine`, `Audio.transcribe_raw`/`translate_raw`, `File.find_matching_files()`, `Deployment` (use `azure-mgmt-cognitiveservices`), `embeddings_utils` (now in cookbook), and W&B CLI (now in own package).",
